> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)
> SELECT thousand, tenthous, thousand + tenthous AS x FROM gpl_u
> UNION ALL
> SELECT 42, 42, hundred FROM gpl_u
> ORDER BY thousand, tenthous
QUERY PLAN:text
Merge Append
  Sort Key: gpl_u.thousand, gpl_u.tenthous
  ->  Index Only Scan using gpl_u_tt on gpl_u
  ->  Sort
        Sort Key: 42, 42
        ->  Seq Scan on gpl_u gpl_u_1
-- EXPLAIN

