> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT min(a), max(a) FROM gpl_pm WHERE b = '12345' AND a < 10
QUERY PLAN:text
Aggregate
  ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on gpl_pm1 gpl_pm
        Recheck Cond: ((a < 10) AND ((b)::text = '12345'::text))
        ->  Bitmap Index Scan on gpl_pm1i
              Index Cond: ((a < 10) AND ((b)::text = '12345'::text))
-- EXPLAIN

